  directions:
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 2
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Why won\u2019t you die??!\r\n"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 2
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "I don\u2019t know, maybe you should ask Dick Nixon for a bigger defense
      budget.\r\n"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 3
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: '....

'
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 8
    rightSpeakerIdx: 3
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "He\u2019s lining your pockets right? Gotta be some kind of military
      base you\u2019re building-"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Well, look at little Nancy Drew here. Almost figured it all out. Suppose
      you\u2019ve earned some answers before I waste you though."
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: Yeah, we set up a base here. Need to be near the action.
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Free love is already on the outs, Civil Rights mutts have been muzzled,
      there\u2019s a disillusioned society ripe for the picking."
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "But how do you do it? Deploying soldiers? Can\u2019t do that, too
      obvious. Besides, our best guys are busy securing the H trade in Cambodia."
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: What you gotta do is infiltrate. Have agitators on the inside that
      know how to stir the pot.
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Government mandates and price gouging can push people down, but controlling
      ideology is how you keep \u2018em there."
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: 'The turn on, tune in, drop out generation has a malleable mind of
      mush. '
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "You need to infect it and kill all that LSD empathy. Convince them
      it\u2019s all bullshit."
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "MK Ultra isn\u2019t a needle you get injected with, it\u2019s carefully
      coordinated thought control."
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: 'Get to the point and waste me already.

'
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: Setting up a base in a hot area like this lets us find potential agitators.
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: Guys on the outs who could easily bend to our control.
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: 'From there we can take them, maybe forcibly but hey, they love big
      brother. '
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: We modify them, give them some enhancements.
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 1
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Make them\u2026 superior. Really it\u2019s a simple-"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 4
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: '!!'
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 5
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: Huh?!
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 5
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Heh\u2026 ok Momma, here I come-\r\n"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Holden
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 6
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: '!'
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: ???
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 6
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "You\u2026 but, how are you alive?!\r\n"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Bark Shaits
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 9
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: 'Holden already told you too much. He had to go, so do you. '
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Bark Shaits
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 9
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "What the hell happened to you? \r"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Bark Shaits
    isLeftSpeaking: 0
    isRightSpeaking: 1
    leftSpeakerIdx: 0
    rightSpeakerIdx: 9
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "My orders are to stop you by any means necessary. Comply or die. 
      \r"
  - leftSpeaker: Uwe
    rightSpeaker: Bark Shaits
    isLeftSpeaking: 1
    isRightSpeaking: 0
    leftSpeakerIdx: 7
    rightSpeakerIdx: 9
    imgIdx: 0
    dialogue: "Yeah whatever man, I just wanna surf, let\u2019s get this shit over
      with.   \r"
